WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.084
Alright, Steph. 

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:01.668
Ready?

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:03.962
Stephen Curry.

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:05.213
Do not rely on him

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:06.172
to run your team. 

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:10.093
He's about 5' 6''.

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:11.970
Looks like a 
little kid. 

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:12.721
150 lbs

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:13.304
soaking wet.

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:15.014
That is when I first 
really understood

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:16.891
I'm different. 

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:18.977
How did I get here?

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:21.229
I was the undersized 
scrawny kid

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:22.439
that was just trying 
to figure out 

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:23.231
how to make it. 

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:24.858
Steph Curry is hurt. 

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.443
I was overwhelmed 
by everything. 

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:27.569
How would 
I respond?

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:30.321
Let the work begin. 

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.283
When you are 
an underdog, 

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:35.326
you have to take 
what is yours. 

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:36.661
Get buckets!

00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:39.497
Davidson College

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:40.582
for the 
sweet sixteen. 

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:42.876
It's not about 
proving 

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:43.918
other people wrong.

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:47.046
It's about proving 
himself right. 

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.758
And that feeling of

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:51.509
being underrated

00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:52.719
will always be

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:54.721
part of the drive that 
keeps me going. 

